{
  "_help": "Mapa para agentes y CI. 'docs': qué documento revisar cuando cambian ciertos archivos (lo usan update-docs, implement-issue y review-pr). 'sensitive': rutas que exigen consultar antes de cambiarlas y correr /security-review (ver AGENTS.md, Autonomía). 'verify': qué correr antes del PR según lo que cambió (scripts/agents/verify.py). 'required': documentos que tienen que existir (lo valida scripts/agents/check-docs.py). 'ignore_check': rutas que check-docs.py no valida, como bitácoras históricas que citan archivos que ya no existen. Globs estilo git: ** cualquier profundidad, * un nivel. Una ruta que empieza con ? es opcional: check-docs no falla si no coincide con ningún archivo (sirve para alternativas de stack, como package.json o *.lock). 'parity': true|false, interruptor del check de paridad de idiomas (cada X.md con su X.es.md): la plantilla lo prende cuando su contenido está traducido y el init lo apaga en los proyectos, que tienen un solo idioma. 'parity_ignore': archivos .md que no tienen versión .es.md (el check de paridad de idiomas; ignore_check no los exime). Las rutas propias del proyecto van sin ?: si dejan de existir, el check falla. TODO: completar con las rutas del proyecto.",
  "docs": [
    {
      "when": [
        "TODO/schema/**",
        "?**/migrations/**"
      ],
      "review": [
        "docs/reference/domain.md",
        "docs/development/architecture.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambió el modelo de datos"
    },
    {
      "when": [
        "TODO/api/routes/**"
      ],
      "review": [
        "docs/development/architecture.md",
        "docs/reference/surfaces.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambió un endpoint o una pantalla"
    },
    {
      "when": [
        "TODO/modules/**"
      ],
      "review": [
        "docs/reference/modules.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambió la responsabilidad de un módulo"
    },
    {
      "when": [
        "?package.json",
        "?**/package.json",
        "?.github/workflows/**"
      ],
      "review": [
        "AGENTS.md",
        "docs/development/setup.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambió un comando, una dependencia o el CI"
    },
    {
      "when": [
        "?infra/**",
        "?Dockerfile",
        "?**/*.toml"
      ],
      "review": [
        "docs/development/deploy.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambió la infraestructura o el deploy"
    },
    {
      "when": [
        ".claude/agents/**",
        "docs/agents/subagent-contract.md"
      ],
      "review": [
        "AGENTS.md",
        "README.md",
        "docs/agents/subagent-contract.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambió un subagente (modelo, herramientas, escalado) o su contrato"
    },
    {
      "when": [
        ".claude/settings.json",
        "scripts/agents/guardrails.py",
        ".codex/hooks.json",
        ".github/hooks/**",
        ".cursor/hooks.json"
      ],
      "review": [
        "AGENTS.md",
        "README.md"
      ],
      "reason": "cambiaron las barandas (qué comandos frena el hook)"
    }
  ],
  "sensitive": [
    {
      "type": "schema",
      "paths": [
        "TODO/schema/**",
        "?**/migrations/**"
      ],
      "skill": "db-migration"
    },
    {
      "type": "auth",
      "paths": [
        "TODO/auth/**",
        "?**/middleware/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "money",
      "paths": [
        "TODO/payments/**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dependencies",
      "paths": [
        "?package.json",
        "?**/package.json",
        "?*.lock",
        "?pnpm-lock.yaml"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "infra",
      "paths": [
        "?infra/**",
        "?.github/workflows/**",
        "?Dockerfile",
        ".claude/settings.json",
        "scripts/agents/guardrails.py",
        ".codex/hooks.json",
        ".github/hooks/**",
        ".cursor/hooks.json"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "public-api",
      "paths": [
        "TODO/public-api/**"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "verify": [
    {
      "name": "docs",
      "always": true,
      "run": "python3 scripts/agents/check-docs.py"
    },
    {
      "name": "shellcheck",
      "when": [
        "**/*.sh"
      ],
      "run": "command -v shellcheck >/dev/null || { echo 'shellcheck is missing: brew install shellcheck (macOS) or apt install shellcheck. This check does not run without it.'; exit 1; }; shellcheck {files}"
    },
    {
      "name": "prepare",
      "when": [
        ".claude/skills/implement-issue/prepare.sh",
        ".claude/skills/implement-issue/test-prepare.sh"
      ],
      "run": "bash .claude/skills/implement-issue/test-prepare.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "agents",
      "when": [
        ".claude/agents/**",
        "docs/agents/subagent-contract.md",
        "scripts/agents/check-docs.py",
        "scripts/agents/test-agents.sh"
      ],
      "run": "bash scripts/agents/test-agents.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "red",
      "when": [
        ".claude/skills/implement-issue/red.sh",
        ".claude/skills/implement-issue/test-red.sh"
      ],
      "run": "bash .claude/skills/implement-issue/test-red.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "orchestrate",
      "when": [
        ".claude/skills/orchestrate/**",
        ".claude/agents/reviewer.md",
        ".claude/skills/implement-issue/SKILL.md",
        ".gitignore",
        "?profiles/small/DELETE"
      ],
      "run": "bash .claude/skills/orchestrate/test-orchestrate.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "retros",
      "when": [
        ".claude/skills/improve-skills/**"
      ],
      "run": "bash .claude/skills/improve-skills/test-retros.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "i18n",
      "when": [
        "scripts/agents/check-docs.py",
        "scripts/agents/agents_map.py",
        "scripts/agents/test-i18n.sh",
        ".github/workflows/docs.yml"
      ],
      "run": "bash scripts/agents/test-i18n.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "base",
      "when": [
        "scripts/agents/**"
      ],
      "run": "bash scripts/agents/test-base.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "guardrails",
      "when": [
        ".claude/settings.json",
        "scripts/agents/guardrails.py",
        "scripts/agents/test_guardrails.py",
        ".codex/hooks.json",
        ".github/hooks/**",
        ".cursor/hooks.json"
      ],
      "run": "python3 -m unittest scripts/agents/test_guardrails.py"
    },
    {
      "name": "init",
      "when": [
        "?scripts/init-template.sh",
        "?scripts/test-init.sh"
      ],
      "run": "bash scripts/test-init.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "update",
      "when": [
        "?scripts/update.py",
        "?scripts/test-update.sh",
        "?scripts/init-template.sh"
      ],
      "run": "bash scripts/test-update.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "renames",
      "when": [
        "?scripts/test-renames.sh"
      ],
      "run": "bash scripts/test-renames.sh"
    },
    {
      "name": "lint",
      "always": true,
      "run": "TODO: comando de lint (por ejemplo: npm run lint)"
    },
    {
      "name": "typecheck",
      "always": true,
      "run": "TODO: comando de typecheck (por ejemplo: npx tsc --noEmit)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tests",
      "always": true,
      "run": "TODO: tests, idealmente solo los afectados (por ejemplo: npx vitest related {files} --run)"
    },
    {
      "name": "migrations",
      "when": [
        "TODO/schema/**",
        "?**/migrations/**"
      ],
      "run": "TODO: verificar que el schema y las migraciones coinciden (generar y comprobar que no queda nada sin commitear)"
    },
    {
      "name": "api-contract",
      "when": [
        "TODO/public-api/**"
      ],
      "run": "TODO: comparar el contrato público contra la base (por ejemplo: un diff de OpenAPI)"
    }
  ],
  "required": [
    "AGENTS.md",
    "docs/README.md",
    "docs/llms.txt",
    "docs/github-naming-convention.md",
    "docs/decisions/README.md",
    "docs/development/architecture.md"
  ],
  "ignore_check": [
    "profiles/**",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "docs/decisions/ADR-001-*"
  ],
  "parity": false,
  "parity_ignore": [
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "docs/decisions/ADR-001-*"
  ]
}
